('bmlt-instauto-20261122-mcq-010','BMLT','BMLT NHPC Licensing','mcq','free',1209,'{"question":"Relative centrifugal force depends on rotor radius and:","translation":"RCF कुन कुरामा पनि निर्भर हुन्छ?","options":["Rotational speed squared","Tube color","Sample pH","Room humidity only"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"RCF increases with rotor radius and the square of rotational speed.","explanationNe":"RCF increases with rotor radius and the square of rotational speed. यसलाई प्रयोग गर्दा सम्बन्धित SOP र manufacturer instruction पालना गर्नुहोस्।","topic":"Centrifugation"}'::jsonb,true),
